<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-06T00:28:21.594Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:28:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked the Akwando community in Kaduna, killing two people and abducting twenty. Bandits later kidnapped a family of seven in another Kaduna raid and a teenager was killed in a separate Plateau attack. Terrorists seized gold fields in Zamfara and expelled elderly residents for forced labor, while the NDLEA stopped an armed robbery on the Kaduna-Zaria highway. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOMUo1Z2VpMkpzZGNCYm5hb0VRNUxPdVZrN1I4ZzB1MUt5bURPN3lXVE0zOWJfWnQ4bFI1UlpkakxDYlhJaG9oUjZBblNvbFNRaHUxX2pFRkFsMUQ4NHNpQnBVa0U1Y1VEaWNiQm9JeXpsS2U5QkdBYm9aVWo4Yjl5OU5YTUlxOTFHSVhiVWpzdHNsdk5Vd3JtaHNNd2w5UTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQTkQtS2tEMTVuS2pzWi10aHIwNUowSHBSOXJ2bDhyS3BaUjc0S0tCQ08yb3M0c1B5SjA4bFVVV0Jwa1FlbjBJQ0JKbUVjbTQ4RDE1MVg2bDY2dUdVczNkek5xRWhCa3Q5bXJnZlozSGJJN290Q2NIcDRFMUFiYVZKbUh3c1g1eVJ4bURDdlI5UjdtZzBsUEtKN1dZT0lreG9CX1ZZSU1TUVZpNWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9GY2ZfTzFuLU1scllYaTRYN1lzZkF6Mmkxb2U3RTgweG5FU0JodWVLSnJ0SG5lQXZ3VDd3N3p5RjJ0Zk9LdnhWTUVmV2d4ZFhvOG9nQ3pyV2p4RU11ZkFZS3Q1Z1NJcTQxQThhNHZ1eGNWRFk0SlptVGNWWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxObXBGbjYwb2xpdExiZnJodHphUU9BdGlUdk5BV042VEh2VUhkNkpwcWN3Y2N5S0t3S0doa09hMFZzUmJkNFotUEdqNGRYZVdNWm1Pd1B1ZUtsZG5ZbV9qRVBXMUxjN2ZvNlJnbXFqTWstOHJZcVBybnNzQkJTWEQtOFVwTmJnOWR1OHdQMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFAta